      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2009-p2.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Squaring both equations and add them together, one obtains \\(1+9 / 4=2+2(\\cos (A) \\cos (B)+\\) \\(\\sin (A) \\sin (B))=2+2 \\cos (A-B)\\). Thus \\(\\cos A-B=5 / 8\\).",
